# Components (View layer)

- Functional components only
- Presentational by default: props in, events out
- Extract reusable pieces into `components/ui/` (Button, Card, FileDrop, StatusBadge)
- Feature components compose UI primitives; they do not reimplement buttons/inputs
- Colocate feature-specific components under `components/{feature}/`
- Server Components by default; add `"use client"` only for interactivity/state
- Keep pages thin: compose components + load data via actions/services

## Do / Don't

```tsx
// ❌ business logic + fetch inside a big page component
// ✅ <MilestoneSubmitForm onSubmit={submitMilestone} /> + action in controller layer
```

- Props: explicit interfaces; avoid prop drilling past 2 levels — use context/store for shared UI state
- Accessibility: labels on inputs, keyboard-usable actions, meaningful button text
